    {
      "source": "Returns the domain class returned by the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a>. In contrast to <a href=\"../RepositoryMetadata.html#getReturnType(java.lang.reflect.Method)\"><code>RepositoryMetadata.getReturnType(Method)</code></a>, this\nmethod extracts the type from <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a>s and <a href=\"../../../domain/Page.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Page</code></a> as well.",
      "translation": "返回给定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a>所对应的域类。与<a href=\"../RepositoryMetadata.html#getReturnType(java.lang.reflect.Method)\"><code>RepositoryMetadata.getReturnType(Method)</code></a>不同，此方法还会从<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a>和<a href=\"../../../domain/Page.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Page</code></a>中提取类型。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the domain type information returned by the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a>. In contrast to\n<a href=\"../RepositoryMetadata.html#getReturnType(java.lang.reflect.Method)\"><code>RepositoryMetadata.getReturnType(Method)</code></a>, this method extracts the type from <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a>s and\n<a href=\"../../../domain/Page.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Page</code></a> as well.",
      "translation": "返回给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"java.lang.reflect 中的类或接口\"><code>Method</code></a> 所返回的域类型信息。与\n<a href=\"../RepositoryMetadata.html#getReturnType(java.lang.reflect.Method)\"><code>RepositoryMetadata.getReturnType(Method)</code></a> 不同，此方法还会从 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>Collection</code></a> 和\n<a href=\"../../../domain/Page.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>Page</code></a> 中提取类型。",
      "count": 2
    },
