    {
      "source": "Returns the domain class returned by the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回由给定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"java.lang.reflect 中的类或接口\"><code>Method</code></a>返回的域类。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the domain type information returned by the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回给定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"java.lang.reflect 中的类或接口\"><code>Method</code></a>所返回的域类型信息。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the type <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a> return type as it is declared in the repository.",
      "translation": "返回仓库中声明的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"java.lang.reflect 中的类或接口\"><code>Method</code></a> 返回类型。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the type <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a> return type as it is declared in the repository. Considers suspended methods and\ndoes not unwrap component types but leaves those for further inspection.",
      "translation": "返回仓库中声明的类型 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Method.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Method</code></a> 的返回类型。该方法会考虑挂起的（suspended）方法，并且不会解包组件类型，而是保留这些类型以供进一步检查。",
      "count": 2
    },
